  "limitation": "Build-specific static and live projectile/terrain/area evidence. HP, breath, frostbite and two condition words are applied by incoming stat dispatch; no local cancellable DOT calculation is established. Legacy entity +0xf8 context is a sprite key, not status flags. Condition context now reads the first two Int32 mask words at +0x250 with explicit provenance. Since build b09e1a2d, projectile hits run through HBEAKBIHANL.BJDEACACFBD, called from the collision method; the game ships unreferenced copies of that handler and of the calculator (2ce88d8b: 6 handlers, 9 calculators), and compatibility/manage.py resolves the live copy by following direct calls from collision. The notification tail is duplicated, so projectile notifications return to two addresses. The second incoming damage handler (KMNAOFNEMKK) no longer exists. Build 2ce88d8b renamed LKHPPBEGNOM.JIBCOPCLAEO to CEHOCGBMDCC.",
